<title>USA: More Sherritt executives to be barred from U.S.</title>
<headline>More Sherritt executives to be barred from U.S.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four more executives of Canada's Sherritt International Corp. are to be banned from entering the United States because of company operations in Cuba, the State Department announced Friday.</p>
<p>Spokesman Nicholas Burns said the department was sending letters to the executives Friday informing them &quot;that they will no longer 45 days after the receipt of the letters be welcome in the United States&quot;.</p>
</text>
